{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Fury of the Wild restores copied boons after dismount (#6495)",
  "contract": [
    "A Boon cast with Fury of the Wild applies to the current living pet at half strength. Normal mounting",
    "temporarily unsummons that persistent pet; dismount must retain its copied permanent Boon without another",
    "Boon cast. Exercise all five Boons with independently authored half-strength amounts before and after",
    "mounting. Remove Fury while mounted as a negative control. Cancel the owner Boon while mounted to verify",
    "its restoration link is cleared, then recast it on the living pet before testing Fury removal."
  ],
